=200&s=3b756e5df968117acb10b67e18e6fdf9, https://si.imgix.net/af74f984/uploads/origins/46983659-ecd1-4999-b9d0-0bae99035514?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6fef4ff03ff5864d0aa9d428c9010226 2x, https://si.imgix.net/af74f984/uploads/origins/46983659-ecd1-4999-b9d0-0bae99035514?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a8cd7ea772e830483f692b7e91b766de 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "你好，请你为我画一下FFXIV的角色吧？\n\n请把她画成一个优雅的姿势。  我认为类似于这些的姿势会很好。\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/89666098\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/82936412\n\n我将把构图和其他细节留给你来决定。  谢谢您!\n\n服装参考: https://imgur.com/a/8lkZLG5\n角色参考: https://imgur.com/a/33nLzKq", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}